In conclusion, we fabricated the inverted PSCs based on PBDTTT-C/ $\mathrm{PC}_{71}\mathrm{BM}$ with iso­ propanol solution-processed TIPD as electron collecting layer on ITO as negative electrode and air-stable $\mathrm{MoO}_{3}/\mathrm{Al}$ as positive electrode.
